    <Label IsHitTestVisible="false" Name="Description" Style="GalleryText" Text="In square ABCD mark points E, F, G and H at\nthe same distance from the corners: AE = BF =\nCG = DH.\n\nEFGH is a square too, and the four corner\ntriangles are congruent right triangles. This\npicture is the heart of a famous proof of the\nPythagorean theorem.\n\nDrag E along the side." DecimalsToShow="2" X="3.82" Y="-4.415" />
